From 6f10a951b82954cec3f7a9c59f99576949394d74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Foxes Hung <foxes687@andestech.com>
Date: Mon, 30 Oct 2023 11:28:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 108/241] target/riscv: Add AndStar V5 v1.5 instructions
 support configs/targets: Add AndesCodene NEXEC.IT configuration support

  Support below new AndeStar V5 v1.5 extensions:
    1. New Code Dense (NEXEC.IT)
    2. INT4 Vector Load (VLN8.V/VLNU8.V)
    3. Scalar BFLOAT16 Conversion (FCVT.S.BF16/FCVT.BF16.S)
    4. Vector BFLOAT16 Conversion (VFWCVT.S.BF16/VFNCVT.BF16.S)
    5. Vector Packed FP16 (VFPMADT.VF/VFPMADB.VF)
    6. Vector Dot Product (VD4DOTS.VV/VD4DOTU.VV/VD4DOTSU.VV)
    7. Vector Small INT Handling (VLE4.V/VFWCVT.F.NU.V/VFWCVT.F.B.V/VFWCVT.F.BU.V/VZEXT.VF2/VZEXT.VF4/VZEXT.VF8/VSEXT.VF2/VSEXT.VF4/VSEXT.VF8)
    8. Vector Quad-Widening Integer Multiply-Add (VQMACCU.VV/VQMACCU.VX/VQMACC.VV/VQMACC.VC/VQMACCSU.VV)

Signed-off-by: Foxes Hung <foxes687@andestech.com>
